  "evidence": "raw.orders has 15000 rows, but stg_orders only 14941 rows, indicating 59 orders were filtered out. The stg_orders SQL includes a WHERE clause that excludes orders with o_orderdate within the last 7 days (o_orderdate < max(o_orderdate) - interval 7 day). This filter drops the most recent orders, causing the freshness check (assert_orders_fresh) to fail (1 stale row) and creating 230 orphaned lineitem rows (relationships_stg_lineitem_order_key__order_key__ref_stg_orders_). The issue originates from the filter logic in the stg_orders model, not from upstream raw data."
